# The test suite is not part of the distribution. ADR-0005 commits this package to
# keeping fixtures out of the sdist, and without this file that held only because
# setuptools' default sdist happens not to pick up `tests/data/*.2dm` -- luck, not a
# decision, and luck that ends the moment anything adds a `graft`.
#
# The PyPI quota argument in ADR-0005 section 1 is what this protects: format fixtures
# are binary, and a distribution carrying them spends a budget that is already short.
prune tests

# Review artefacts written into the repo root by the review workflow.
exclude pr-diff-review-*.md
